  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://creeperhost.net/applyPromo/HomeGrownMods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/576589/description_c104abd7-58db-4f58-b718-a8ddafa3364f.png\"></a></p>\n\n\n<p>“PolyLib”由CreeperHost有限公司开发，是一款轻量级的Minecraft库模组，专注于提供一套辅助类。这些类旨在简化模组开发的各个环节，提供便捷的GUI创建工具及其他开发增强功能，以提升开发效率与用户体验。</p>\n\n<p>PolyLib基于<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a>构建，适用于NeoForge、Forge和Fabric平台。</p>\n<p>PolyLib为开源项目，代码托管于<a href=\"https://github.com/CreeperHost/PolyLib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>。</p>\n\n<p><strong>依赖PolyLib的模组</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/creeperhost-presents-soul-shards\" rel=\"nofollow\">SoulShards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blockshot\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlockShot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/creeperhost-minetogether\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineTogether</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Jab125/Jab125/main/imgs/requiredArchitecturyApi.png\" width=\"382\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><br>&nbsp;</p>",
